---
import PageLayout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout title="What We Do" description="Multi-day itineraries, day experiences, custom trip design, and itinerary planning. Whatever your client needs, we can probably build it.">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-brand-800 text-white py-20 md:py-28" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(42,34,24,0.6), rgba(42,34,24,0.5)), url(https://cdn.simplyenak.com/cte-hero-food.jpg) center/cover no-repeat;">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-white max-w-2xl">What your clients can actually do.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-white/85 max-w-3xl">Most of the time, a client's request starts somewhere in between our standard options. That's fine. We build around it. Here is what we can put together.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-2">What We Handle</span>
      <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <a href="/what-we-do/" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border-2 border-accent shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Most Common Request</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Multi-Day Itineraries</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">3 to 7 days of eating through Malaysia. Every stop scouted, every meal tested, every guide trained by us. You sell it, we run it.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/what-we-do/" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Half or Full Day</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Day Experiences</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Morning market walks, afternoon cooking classes, evening hawker crawls. Standalone or bolted onto an existing trip.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/what-we-do/" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">When Standards Don't Fit</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Custom Trips</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Your client's diet, group size, or theme doesn't fit the standard routes. We build something that does.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/what-we-do/" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Just the Plan</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Itinerary Planning</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">You want the local knowledge but you prefer to run things yourself. We plan the route, you operate it.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/what-we-do/" class="block p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">For Groups</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Corporate & Events</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">Team cooking sessions, incentive trip food stops, gala dinners with local menus.</p>
          <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-accent font-medium">Learn more &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-brand-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="inline-block text-accent text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-2">How It Works</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-brand-900 max-w-2xl">From brief to delivery.</h2>
      <div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Step 1</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Brief</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">You tell us about your client: dates, group size, budget, dietary needs, what they care about.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Step 2</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Draft</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">We build a proposed itinerary with specific restaurants, markets, cooking classes, and guides.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Step 3</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Refine</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">We adjust based on your feedback. Swap stops, add rest time, change the pacing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-100">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide">Step 4</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-serif font-semibold text-brand-900">Deliver</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-brand-700">We run it. Dedicated guide, printed day-by-day, direct number for anything.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-brand-800 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold">Ready to build something?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-white/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Tell us about your client or group and we will come back with a proposal within 48 hours.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/contact.html" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-accent text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors">
          Get in Touch
        </a>
        <a href="/trade-kit.html" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 border border-white/50 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
          Request Trade Kit
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</PageLayout>
